10:T7f5,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"ミュージカル『テニスの王子様』","description":"2.5次元ミュージカルの原点となった記念すべき初演。テニスの名門・青春学園中等部に入学した天才少年・越前リョーマが、校内ランキング戦を勝ち抜きレギュラーの座をつかむまでを描く。光と音でボールのラリーを表現する革新的な演出手法が誕生し、口コミで人気が爆発した伝説的公演。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/tennimu-1st-initial","keywords":"青春・熱量, 群像・チーム感, 学園要素, ジャンプ原作","about":"ミュージカル『テニスの王子様』1st シーズン（テニミュ1st）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"上島 雪夫","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/ueshima-yukio"},{"@type":"Person","name":"一太郎","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/ichitaro"},{"@type":"Person","name":"青山 草太","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aoyama-sota"},{"@type":"Person","name":"森山 栄治","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/moriyama-eiji"},{"@type":"Person","name":"郷本 直也","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/gomoto-naoya"},{"@type":"Person","name":"柳 浩太郎","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/yanagi-kotaro"},{"@type":"Person","name":"阿部 よしつぐ","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/abe-yoshitsugu"},{"@type":"Person","name":"滝川 英治","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/takigawa-eiji"},{"@type":"Person","name":"石橋 裕輔（YU-SUKE）","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/ishibashi-yusuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"豊永 利行","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/toyonaga-toshiyuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"KIMERU（Kimeru）","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kimeru"},{"@type":"Person","name":"土屋 佑壱（土屋 裕一）","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/tsuchiya-yuichi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"堀田 勝","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/hotta-masaru"}]}5:["$","main",null,{"className":"container","style":{"paddingBlock":32},"children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$10"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"stack-lg","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"hero-card stack-md","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Play Detail SSR"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"page-title","children":"ミュージカル『テ